# Contracts (`packages/contracts`)

- One file per domain (`auth.ts`, `users.ts`, `business.ts`, …), re-exported from `src/index.ts`
  with `.js` extensions. Naming: `xxxSchema` + `export type Xxx = z.infer<typeof xxxSchema>` right
  after it. Shared building blocks live in `primitives.ts`, `money.ts`, `pagination.ts`,
  `locale.ts`.
- API JSON is camelCase; times are ISO-8601 UTC strings; money is `{ amount, currency }` in minor
  units (`moneySchema`); lists use `paginationQuerySchema` + `paginated(item)` →
  `{ items, nextCursor }`.
- Error codes: add to `ERROR_CODES` in `src/error.ts` (grouped by comment) **and** add
  `errors.<CODE>` to `packages/i18n/src/catalogs/<locale>/errors.json` for en/me/ru/tr — the
  contracts test enforces the match.
- Never import Prisma or Nest here; contracts are consumed by api, web and mobile.
- Dual ESM/CJS build via tsup; `dual-module.test.ts` checks `dist` — do not break `exports`.
